title Vinyl now playing in portrait (the 320x480 draft scaled, PDA 480x800 and 480x640): the toolkit's header with the app title (design QA D-10), one row of chips
sizes 480x800 480x640
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot now-playing
expect esc
expect text "Vinyl"
expect text "Phoenix"
expect text "Vol 60"
expect text "Queue"
expect text "Output"
expect noquit
